<title>USA: Ameriwood Industries Inc Q3 profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Ameriwood Industries Inc Q3 profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>GRAND RAPIDS, Mich. 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
